Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,… (ﾊｷﾞｽ)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах, а...
